### List events (first page, ordered by start time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=MUSIC

### Combine filters and paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=TECH&city=Cluj-Napoca&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&page=0&size=5

### Get event details
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1

### Create an event (the organizer is the current user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Board game night",
  "description": "Bring your favourite game.",
  "category": "OTHER",
  "startsAt": "2030-01-10T18:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2030-01-10T21:00:00Z",
  "locationName": "Game Cafe",
  "city": "Cluj-Napoca",
  "capacity": 20,
  "imageUrl": null
}

### Edit an event (only its organizer, otherwise 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Board game night, new venue",
  "description": "Bring your favourite game.",
  "category": "OTHER",
  "startsAt": "2030-01-10T18:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2030-01-10T21:00:00Z",
  "locationName": "Game Cafe",
  "city": "Cluj-Napoca",
  "capacity": null,
  "imageUrl": null
}
